        "question": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "关于慢性肾脏病(CKD)的定义与分期, 下列叙述正确的是:"
          }
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "只要血肌酐超过参考上限即可诊断CKD",
            "correct": false,
            "option_id": "9a800fac-5c8b-4024-800e-f51e6db98faa"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "肾损伤标志(如白蛋白尿)或eGFR下降持续≥3个月方可诊断, 分期需同时标注病因(C), G期与白蛋白尿(A)期",
            "correct": false,
            "option_id": "62fa50a0-29f2-4f96-99b7-c7100ff213bf"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "CKD仅按eGFR分为5期, G3期为30-59 ml/min/1.73m²",
            "correct": false,
            "option_id": "2d587221-6592-49e6-af12-9ffe56938401"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "eGFR 60-89 ml/min/1.73m²且无肾损伤标志者属于G2期",
            "correct": false,
            "option_id": "e6810bb4-bf94-41a3-8636-254604d517a0"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "进入G5期即意味着必须立即开始透析",
            "correct": false,
            "option_id": "a319da77-1537-496c-9e97-38ed71e854e9"
          }
        ],
        "sources": [
