      {
        "question_id": "fabf304b-d48e-428f-99d8-9283588d6b70",
        "question": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "关于血液透析(HD), 血液透析滤过(HDF)与腹膜透析(PD)的原理, 正确的是:"
          }
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "血液透析以对流清除为主",
            "correct": false,
            "option_id": "0d50a80e-d714-4e46-bd4e-e56dc84a351c"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "血液透析以小分子弥散清除为主; HDF通过对流增加中分子清除; 腹膜透析以腹膜为半透膜, 兼有弥散与超滤",
            "correct": true,
            "option_id": "8606e816-e021-44ae-bfd4-17fa74a76ce2"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "腹膜透析对中分子的清除优于HDF",
            "correct": false,
            "option_id": "24fe6aef-0cdd-4a8f-929c-4201981f3b9b"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "腹膜透析患者不需要限制水盐摄入",
            "correct": false,
            "option_id": "d49e6ef8-73c1-4d96-8c61-2f2addf40391"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "三种方式对残余肾功能的影响相同",
            "correct": false,
            "option_id": "32d008e2-f1cb-4fd1-a3aa-7c9368b4bf39"
          }
        ],
